737
00:40:38.018 --> 00:40:39.711
Can you stop her?
Use the kill switch.

738
00:40:39.811 --> 00:40:41.213
<i>She already deleted it.</i>

739
00:40:41.313 --> 00:40:43.383
<i>I might still be able
