768
00:42:33.550 --> 00:42:35.719
<i>Bravo. are you there? Do you copy?</i>

769
00:42:38.847 --> 00:42:39.831
Go secure.

770
00:42:39.931 --> 00:42:41.626
<i>Sir. I have eyes
