a bad person.

951
00:54:30.809 --> 00:54:33.311
Everyone deserves
a second chance.

952
00:54:33.436 --> 00:54:34.630
All right.

953
00:54:34.730 --> 00:54:36.923
I recognize that you are
just trying to help.

954
00:54:37.023 --> 00:54:39.009
but you need to consider
the possibility

955
00:54:39.108 --> 00:54:41.177
