get the equipment?

977
00:55:46.510 --> 00:55:47.952
Oh. Of course.

978
00:55:48.052 --> 00:55:49.954
Why wouldn't
she have that? Yeah.

979
00:55:50.054 --> 00:55:52.458
All right. if M3gan is going
