- What about it?

991
00:56:37.603 --> 00:56:39.171
People know
what you look like.

992
00:56:39.271 --> 00:56:40.923
- People are morons.
- M3gan.

993
00:56:41.023 --> 00:56:42.423
if anyone recognized you…

994
00:56:42.523 --> 00:56:44.009
Change my face.
and I'll change yours.

995
00:56:44.108 --> 00:56:45.318
