1067
01:00:45.516 --> 01:00:47.126
Neither does Amelia

1068
01:00:47.226 --> 01:00:49.771
But she appears to have a lead
on someone who does.

1069
01:00:51.356 --> 01:00:52.923
- Wait. what?
- You may recall that

1070
01:00:53.023 --> 01:00:54.384
before his anti-Al crusade.

1071
01:00:54.483 --> 01:00:56.762
