Amelia's already
generated fake credentials

1083
01:01:19.967 --> 01:01:21.119
for the same event.

1084
01:01:21.219 --> 01:01:22.746
All I need to do is
get close to him

1085
01:01:22.846 --> 01:01:24.081
and wait for her to show

