1185
01:06:24.646 --> 01:06:26.383
Look at her diagnostics.

1186
01:06:26.483 --> 01:06:28.175
She's not just reasoning.
She's feeling.

1187
01:06:28.275 --> 01:06:30.095
No. Cady.
she's diverging!

1188
01:06:30.195 --> 01:06:32.097
And the last time
