1194
01:06:45.585 --> 01:06:46.778
but I… I appreciate
you read…

1195
01:06:46.878 --> 01:06:48.086
uh…

1196
01:06:48.213 --> 01:06:49.322
I appreciate you
reading the. uh…

1197
01:06:49.422 --> 01:06:50.824
Oh. you know what?
I'm… I'm gonna take this.

1198
01:06:50.923 --> 01:06:52.800
Okay. Thank you.

1199
01:06:53.550 --> 01:06:55.327
